        <p>FT IS NOT as ordinary cocoas</p>
        <p>are of inferior quality. Even some of the cocoas which are advertised as pure are poor, inasmuch as they are made froin •</p>
        <p>cheap beans imported from regions in which it is irnpossib!e, for climatin reasons.' to grow cacao beans of high quabty.</p>
