        <p>Hoist Accident at Messrs. Crosfield's Works.</p>
        <p>About halt-past one on Monday afternoon, a youth named Herbert Davies, Who resides in Lockett-street, Latchford, was admitted into the Infirmary suffering from a crushed foot. It anpears that in the course of his employment he had occa- sion to use the hoist at Messrs Crosfield's works,and in some way got his foot crushed. The injury is not of a serious nature.</p>
