        <p>- 11,4411W11_ "When I commenced to take Dr. WILLIAMS' PINK PILLS FOR PALE PEOPL • I weighed just about - 7 stone, that is 98 lbs• I have gained - 3 stone, that is 42 lbs. in weight during that period. Present weight stone, or 140 lbs, I had been six months in Hospital and six months attending a Dispensary." Extract from Mrs. Perry's attested statement The speaker of these remarkable words is Mrs. Perry, the wife of a well-known citizen in a good position in life, and residing .1.75, Bolton Road, Small Heath, Birmingham. "An aggravated form of indigestion," said Mrs. Perry, " made me very ill. I was six months at the Hospital, and six in attending a Dispensary, but I felt no better after this long treatment. I was in such a low state at times that I felt I could not take medicine that was given to me. I could scarcely hold a broom. I was trembling all over my body. "I can truly say that the full credit for my recovery is due to Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People. My digestive organs were such a weak state that I could not digest even bread. If I had not taken Dr. 'Williams' Pink Pills fOr Pale People I should not be here novi After the first box I felt relieved, and much better, and after the second box I could digest my food. "I have great faith in Dr. Williams' Pink Pills," continued Mrs. Perry, " and my children can testify that when I commenced to them I was only just about seven stone in weight, while now lam over ten. I have gained three stone in weight daring that teriod, Dr. Williams' Pills have done me more good than anything I tried before taking them: they braced me up. One of my daughters who was very arhemic obtained great benefit from the pills."</p>
